  "content": {
    "id": "p35-q20-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "20",
    "prompt": "The width of a door type almost certainly lies in the range 814 mm to 826 mm (3 standard deviations from the mean).",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p35-q20-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Find the standard deviation.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$2\\text{ mm}$",
          "worked": "The interval spans $3\\sigma$ on each side of the mean, so its total width is $6\\sigma$.\n$$\\begin{align*}6\\sigma&=826-814\\\\6\\sigma&=12\\\\\\sigma&=2\\text{ mm}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "p35-q20-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Find the mean width.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$820\\text{ mm}$",
          "worked": "The mean is the midpoint of the interval.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\mu&=\\frac{814+826}{2}\\\\\\mu&=820\\text{ mm}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 13
      },
      {
        "id": "p35-q20-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Within what widths do 95% of doors lie?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$816\\text{ mm}$ to $824\\text{ mm}$",
          "worked": "By the empirical rule, approximately 95% of widths lie within $2\\sigma$ of the mean.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\mu-2\\sigma&=820-2(2)\\\\\\mu-2\\sigma&=816\\text{ mm}\\\\\\mu+2\\sigma&=820+2(2)\\\\\\mu+2\\sigma&=824\\text{ mm}\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore, the widths lie approximately between $816\\text{ mm}$ and $824\\text{ mm}$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      }
    ]
  },
